Meet the professional boxing round timer! This app, simple and easy to use, is suitable for any type of training and competition preparation. Use the timer during boxing training, martial arts and wrestling classes, fitness, etc. 

Features:

- ability to create your own timers;
-Intuitive interface;
- Flexible settings of intervals, suitable not only for professionals, but also for beginners in sports;
- ready-made profiles for different sports;
- Signals of the beginning and end of rounds. 

Boxing timer is one of the best applications for amateur and professional boxing, MMA and any other martial arts and an excellent assistant for training at home.

Privacy Policy: https://appbox.pw/privacy/privacy/privacy.html
Terms of Use: https://appbox.pw/privacy/privacy/terms.html

· Record your fitness accurately
Support running, cycling, walking and other activities;
· Multi-dimensional evaluation of body state
Make fitness, weight loss and exercise more scientific through FitFly;
Each exercise can obtain professional physiological indexes, so that exercise more scientific and effective;
· Find more fun in life
Support exercise track record, playback of your fitness records;
Tips:
This application supports Apple Health. With authorization, you can synchronize your steps, sleep, heart rate and other health data to Apple Health.
